{"id":"inmortal","lemma":"inmortal","pos":"adj","rank":3774,"glosses":["immortal (not susceptible to death)","immortal (never to be forgotten)"],"ipa":"/immoɾˈtal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"inmortales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-inmortal.wav","examples":[{"text":"El amor es inmortal.","en":"Love is immortal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538361","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"El alma es inmortal.","en":"The soul is immortal.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"soul"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"El cuerpo del hombre es mortal, pero su alma es inmortal.","en":"A man's body dies, but his soul is immortal.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"body"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"deadly"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"soul"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}